1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,536
The waterwheel in part three,

2
00:00:03,593 --> 00:00:04,260
you draw it.

3
00:00:04,885 --> 00:00:05,435
D-Draw…

4
00:00:05,554 --> 00:00:06,710
Draw what?

5
00:00:06,856 --> 00:00:07,450
Ahem,

6
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,454
Nonsense!

7
00:00:08,513 --> 00:00:09,384
Beat him!

8
00:00:09,999 --> 00:00:10,517
Wait.

9
00:00:10,703 --> 00:00:11,955
Give them paper.

10
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:13,068
You memorized the words,

11
00:00:13,436 --> 00:00:14,639
but the waterwheel?

12
00:00:21,491 --> 00:00:23,047
Twelve blades,

13
00:00:24,296 --> 00:00:25,628
angled three degrees.

14
00:00:27,865 --> 00:00:28,433
Correct,

15
00:00:28,632 --> 00:00:29,954
that's the one.

16
00:00:30,345 --> 00:00:31,017
Wei Xun,

17
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:32,256
where's your waterwheel?

18
00:00:34,607 --> 00:00:35,047
The blades,

19
00:00:35,247 --> 00:00:36,788
why mount them backward?

20
00:00:36,874 --> 00:00:37,165
I…

21
00:00:37,252 --> 00:00:38,303
What I memorized…

22
00:00:38,396 --> 00:00:38,860
Memorized?

23
00:00:38,983 --> 00:00:40,128
Memorized from whom?

24
00:00:41,454 --> 00:00:43,745
The first time, I put them in backward,

25
00:00:43,825 --> 00:00:45,349
and the wheel wouldn't turn.

26
00:00:45,765 --> 00:00:47,184
My little sister held up a pinwheel,

27
00:00:47,332 --> 00:00:48,861
and then I flipped them around.

28
00:00:49,182 --> 00:00:50,045
Before the exam,

29
00:00:50,113 --> 00:00:51,653
in my study,

30
00:00:51,728 --> 00:00:52,966
he drew this very wheel.

31
00:00:53,585 --> 00:00:53,943
Ahem,

32
00:00:54,076 --> 00:00:56,791
A scholar reciting his texts,

33
00:00:57,256 --> 00:00:59,312
what's so odd about that!

34
00:00:59,378 --> 00:01:00,000
My lord!

35
00:01:00,137 --> 00:01:01,944
This humble woman has something to present!

36
00:01:02,021 --> 00:01:03,170
That man from the Wei family,

37
00:01:03,239 --> 00:01:05,026
came to see Examiner Feng again.

38
00:01:05,415 --> 00:01:07,195
This is the second packet,

39
00:01:07,262 --> 00:01:07,928
I took it off his hands.

40
00:01:10,362 --> 00:01:11,371
Five hundred taels,

41
00:01:11,461 --> 00:01:13,290
paid in full when the results are posted.

42
00:01:13,368 --> 00:01:14,656
I know this seal,

43
00:01:14,721 --> 00:01:16,351
Wei Shaoqing's steward.

44
00:01:16,422 --> 00:01:16,798
My lord,

45
00:01:17,218 --> 00:01:19,570
I've been wronged…

46
00:01:19,638 --> 00:01:20,445
Seize him!

47
00:01:23,238 --> 00:01:23,826
Leave us.

48
00:01:26,438 --> 00:01:27,325
Accuse the Wei family,

49
00:01:27,571 --> 00:01:29,787
and the case goes to the capital.

50
00:01:29,895 --> 00:01:31,560
Three years with no verdict,

51
00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:33,092
and your exam year is lost.

52
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,102
Try only Examiner Feng,

53
00:01:35,169 --> 00:01:36,062
and tomorrow,

54
00:01:36,125 --> 00:01:37,526
you're Jieyuan, first in the province.

55
00:01:37,645 --> 00:01:40,176
Choice: bring down the Wei clan,

56
00:01:40,261 --> 00:01:42,951
or take Jieyuan first.
